nce.\", \"sku\": \"BL-DVL084\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl084\", \"category\": \"dvled\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-dvl084.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 4000, \"highPrice\": 40000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl084\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.84mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,200 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"Up to 8K x 4K\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.84mm, which ensures ultra-fine image detail and stunning clarity. This is ideal for close viewing distances in home cinemas where image sharpness is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm and is it suitable for different lighting environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It delivers a peak brightness of 1,200 nits, providing vibrant images even in ambient light conditions commonly found in luxury residential settings and VIP lounges.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm display cinematic HDR content?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports HDR10, HDR10+, and HLG HDR standards, combined with 20-bit color depth and a DCI-P3 95% color gamut for rich, realistic cinematic colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MICRO AI processor enhance the viewing experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"MICRO AI performs real-time optimization of images and video, improving contrast, detail, and color precision dynamically to deliver a superior and immersive home cinema experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What size options are available and can the display be custom-sized?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Modular panels allow scalable sizes from 146 inches up to 265 inches diagonal, enabling flexible installation tailored to the ideal viewing environment and room size.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm compare to OLED or traditional projection for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike OLED or projection, it provides infinite true black with no screen burn risk, maintains high brightness in lit rooms, and supports ultra-high resolution up to 8K for unparalleled detail.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical warranty and after-sales support for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty with support covering hardware and software, ensuring reliability and ongoing performance suited to premium installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm suitable for environments other than home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is perfect for VIP lounges, yachts, and other luxury spaces requiring immersive, high fidelity visual experiences with flexible sizing and outstanding brightness.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"DVLED Cinema 0.84mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl084\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>DVLED Cinema 0.84mm</h1><p>Experience cinema-grade visuals with DVLED Cinema 0.84mm. Available in Dubai and UAE. Elevate your viewing. Contact Brightluxx now!</p><p><strong>Home cinema. 265 inches. Zero compromise.</strong></p><p>Direct View LED for luxury residential and private cinema installations. Modular panels scale from 146 to 265 inches. 20-bit color processing, 8K support, MICRO AI Processor for real-time optimization. The ultimate home theater experience.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm and why does it matter?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.84mm, which ensures ultra-fine image detail and stunning clarity. This is ideal for close viewing distances in home cinemas where image sharpness is critical.</p><h3>How bright is the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm and is it suitable for different lighting environments?</h3><p>It delivers a peak brightness of 1,200 nits, providing vibrant images even in ambient light conditions commonly found in luxury residential settings and VIP lounges.</p><h3>Can the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm display cinematic HDR content?</h3><p>Yes, it supports HDR10, HDR10+, and HLG HDR standards, combined with 20-bit color depth and a DCI-P3 95% color gamut for rich, realistic cinematic colors.</p><h3>How does the MICRO AI processor enhance the viewing experience?</h3><p>MICRO AI performs real-time optimization of images and video, improving contrast, detail, and color precision dynamically to deliver a superior and immersive home cinema experience.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static