ame\": \"DVLED Cinema 0.84mm\", \"description\": \"Direct View LED for luxury residential and private cinema installations. Modular panels scale from 146 to 265 inches. 20-bit color processing, 8K support, MICRO AI Processor for real-time optimization. The ultimate home theater experience.\", \"sku\": \"BL-DVL084\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl084\", \"category\": \"dvled\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-dvl084.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 4000, \"highPrice\": 40000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl084\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.84mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,200 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"Up to 8K x 4K\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Taa4,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.84mm, which ensures ultra-fine image detail and stunning clarity. This is ideal for close viewing distances in home cinemas where image sharpness is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm and is it suitable for different lighting environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It delivers a peak brightness of 1,200 nits, providing vibrant images even in ambient light conditions commonly found in luxury residential settings and VIP lounges.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm display cinematic HDR content?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports HDR10, HDR10+, and HLG HDR standards, combined with 20-bit color depth and a DCI-P3 95% color gamut for rich, realistic cinematic colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MICRO AI processor enhance the viewing experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"MICRO AI performs real-time optimization of images and video, improving contrast, detail, and color precision dynamically to deliver a superior and immersive home cinema experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What size options are available and can the display be custom-sized?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Modular panels allow scalable sizes from 146 inches up to 265 inches diagonal, enabling flexible installation tailored to the ideal viewing environment and room size.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm compare to OLED or traditional projection for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike OLED or projection, it provides infinite true black with no screen burn risk, maintains high brightness in lit rooms, and supports ultra-high resolution up to 8K for unparalleled detail.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical warranty and after-sales support for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty with support covering hardware and software, ensuring reliability and ongoing performance suited to premium installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm suitable for environments other than home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is perfect for VIP lounges, yachts, and other luxury spaces requiring immersive, high fidelity visual experiences with flexible sizing and outstanding brightness.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"DVLED Cinema 0.84mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-dvl084\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\