ht conditions commonly found in luxury residential settings and VIP lounges.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm display cinematic HDR content?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it supports HDR10, HDR10+, and HLG HDR standards, combined with 20-bit color depth and a DCI-P3 95% color gamut for rich, realistic cinematic colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MICRO AI processor enhance the viewing experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"MICRO AI performs real-time optimization of images and video, improving contrast, detail, and color precision dynamically to deliver a superior and immersive home cinema experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What size options are available and can the display be custom-sized?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Modular panels allow scalable sizes from 146 inches up to 265 inches diagonal, enabling flexible installation tailored to the ideal viewing environment and room size.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm compare to OLED or traditional projection for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike OLED or projection, it provides infinite true black with no screen burn risk, maintains high brightness in lit rooms, and supports ultra-high resolution up to 8K for unparalleled detail.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical warranty and after-sales support for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty with support covering hardware and software, ensuring reliability and ongoing performance suited to premium installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the DVLED Cinema 0.84mm suitable for environments other than home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is perf